{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hant",
  "strings": {
    " · 列車暫時依時刻表位置顯示，未套用誤點，今日動態也暫時無法跟車": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " · Trains temporarily use scheduled positions without delays; following from Today’s TRA Status is also unavailable"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "・列車は一時的に時刻表上の位置で表示し、遅延は反映しません。「今日の台湾鉄路」からの追跡も利用できません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " ±10 分　": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " ±10 min · "
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " ±10分　"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " 起": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " onward"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "から"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "，同一顆倍率同時吃字級、列高與觸控目標，所以不會出現「字大了但按鈕沒變大」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ". The same scale applies to text, row height and tap targets, so buttons grow together with the text."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "。同じ倍率を文字・行の高さ・タップ範囲へ適用するため、文字だけが大きくなってボタンが変わらないことはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "，更新 {n} 個既有地點": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ", updated {n} existing places"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "、既存の{n}件を更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "，看接下來有哪些車要進站、還有幾分鐘": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " to see upcoming trains and arrival times."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "をタップすると次の列車と到着までの時間を確認できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "，排定時誤點 +{n} 分": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ", running {n} min late when this was shared"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "、設定時は{n}分遅れ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "，鏡頭就跟著那班車跑": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " to follow that train."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "をタップすると追跡します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "、": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ", "
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "、"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "；{n} 個因收藏已滿略過": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "; skipped {n} because favourites are full"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "；お気に入り上限のため{n}件を除外"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "；另有 {n} 條線的即時資料異常，已改用官方名冊或班表": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "; {n} other lines have live-data issues and now use an official roster or timetable"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "；ほか{n}路線はリアルタイムデータ異常のため公式名簿または時刻表を使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "；有異常公告會提醒": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "; service alerts will be shown"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "；運行情報がある場合は通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "；災害觸發來源：NCDR 生效中示警": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "; hazard trigger: active NCDR warning"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "；災害検出元：発令中のNCDR警報"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "；班次名冊仍依官方班距推算": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "; the service roster is still estimated from official headways"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "；列車名簿は公式運転間隔から推定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "；最近一次更新失敗：{error}": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "; latest update failed: {error}"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "；直近の更新失敗：{error}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "：看板與時刻表明顯不符，位置僅供參考": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ": arrival boards differ substantially from the timetable; positions are for reference only"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "：案内表示と時刻表が大きく異なるため、位置は参考表示です"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "。示警來源暫時無法更新，目前沿用尚未到期的上次成功資料": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ". The warning feed is temporarily unavailable, so the latest successful data is being used until it expires"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "。警報データを一時更新できないため、有効期限内の前回取得データを使用しています"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· 下一班即將進站": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· Next train arriving soon"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "・次の列車がまもなく到着"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· 下一班進站": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
