      }
    },
    "「大」只放大字級與列高，功能位置不變。「特大」會把誤點、方向這類次要欄位收進列的「更多」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Large increases text and row height without moving features. Extra large moves secondary fields such as delays and direction into each row’s More section."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「大」は文字と行の高さだけを拡大し、機能の位置は変えません。「特大」では遅延や方向などの補助項目を各行の「その他」へまとめます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「大」只放大字級與列高，功能位置完全不變；跟隨系統只在字級進到輔助使用級別才介入。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Larger settings increase text and row height without moving features. System following only takes effect at accessibility text sizes."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大きい設定では文字と行の高さだけが変わり、機能の位置は変わりません。システム追従はアクセシビリティ文字サイズでだけ有効になります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「永保安康」吉祥車票的一端，日式木造站房": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One end of the auspicious “Yongkang–Bao’an” ticket, with a Japanese wooden station."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "縁起切符「永保安康」の一方で、木造駅舎が残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
