    "1998 年起投入的冷氣柴油客車，自帶柴油引擎、不靠電車線，專跑平溪、深澳、集集與內灣（竹中以南）等未電氣化支線。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Air-conditioned diesel railcars introduced in 1998 for non-electrified branches including Pingxi, Shen’ao, Jiji and the southern Neiwan Line."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1998年から運用する冷房付き気動車で、平渓、深澳、集集、内湾線南部など非電化支線を走ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2021 年起投入的日立製城際電聯車，安靜平穩，設「騰雲座艙」商務車廂。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A quiet, smooth Hitachi intercity EMU introduced in 2021, with the Tengyun business cabin."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2021年登場の日立製都市間電車で、静かで滑らかな乗り心地とビジネスクラス「騰雲座艙」を備えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
