    "也可以在 App 內從 Google Maps 的「已儲存」清單匯入（需軌島通行證）；檔案只在這台裝置解析，不會上傳。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app can also import Google Maps Saved lists with a Rail Island Pass. Files are processed only on this device and are never uploaded."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appでは軌島パスを使ってGoogle Mapsの保存済みリストも読み込めます。ファイルは端末内だけで解析し、アップロードしません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
