    "切換：全台／台鐵／高鐵／捷運": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch: Nationwide / TRA / HSR / Metro"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切替：台湾全土／台湾鉄路／高鉄／メトロ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切換不會重新框景——你原本看的地方還在原地。字級調大時那顆鈕會跟著變大，但位置不變。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switching does not reset the map view. The button grows with larger text but stays in the same place."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "切り替えても地図の表示範囲は変わりません。文字を大きくするとボタンも大きくなりますが、位置は変わりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切換到含車站的檢視再定位": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch to a view with stations and try again"
