          }
        }
      }
    },
    "另有 {n} 筆未列出；可先完成這批再重新匯入。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "{n} more are not shown. Finish this batch, then import again."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ほか{n}件は表示していません。この分を完了してから再度読み込めます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只在上車、下車兩個點用到你的位置，中間由列車自己的時刻推算，所以進隧道、關螢幕都不影響。上車時就要選下車站，否則忘了按下車會一路蓋到終點。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Location is used only when boarding and alighting. The train timetable handles the journey, so tunnels and a locked screen are fine. Choose the destination when boarding or collection continues to the terminus."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位置は乗車時と下車時だけ利用し、途中は時刻表で進行するためトンネルや画面ロックでも動作します。乗車時に下車駅を選んでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有通過列車 · 可在設定開啟「含通過列車」": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only passing trains · turn on \"Include passing trains\" in settings"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通過列車のみ・設定で「通過列車も表示」をオンにできます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只看這些": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
