      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trains follow today’s timetable. Supported lines use official arrival-board corrections; the Circular Line uses New Taipei Metro train tracking and the Wenhu Line is estimated from headways."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各路線は当日の時刻表で運行し、対応路線は公式到着案内で補正します。環状線は新北メトロの列車位置情報、文湖線は運転間隔からの推定です。"
