        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "抜林"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖曳地圖時，軌道與列車不再比底圖慢半拍；縮放（手機兩指、滑鼠滾輪）收尾的那一瞬，軌道不會先跳回原處再彈回來": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tracks and trains now stay aligned with the base map while dragging. They also remain stable when pinch or wheel zooming ends."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地図をドラッグするとき、線路と列車が背景地図から遅れなくなりました。ピンチ／ホイールズーム終了時の跳ね戻りも解消しました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖倍速滑桿，1× 到 60×": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag the speed slider from 1× to 60×"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "速度スライダーを1×〜60×で調整"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "放空模式": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ambient mode"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鑑賞モード"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "放空模式改成看戲不操作：地圖不會被手指拉歪，離開放空鈕按得到": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ambient mode is now sit-back-and-watch: the map can no longer be dragged or pinched off course, and the Exit ambient mode button stays visible and easy to tap."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "環境モードは「眺めるだけ」に：地図が指で動かされたりズームがずれたりしなくなり、「環境モードを終了」ボタンも見えたまま押しやすくなりました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "放空模式的背景音樂重新整理過：曲目從 29 首增加到 57 首，分成 Afloat、Midnight stories、Moonlake、Rainy day、Star & Neon、peaceful piano 六組不同氛圍": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ambient-mode music grew from 29 to 57 tracks across six moods: Afloat, Midnight stories, Moonlake, Rainy day, Star & Neon and peaceful piano."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鑑賞モードのBGMを29曲から57曲へ増やし、Afloat、Midnight stories、Moonlake、Rainy day、Star & Neon、peaceful pianoの6つの雰囲気に分けました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
