    "近 30 天平均誤點 {average} 分・準點 {rate}%（{days} 天）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "30-day average delay {average} min · {rate}% on time ({days} days)"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "過去30日平均遅延{average}分・定時{rate}%（{days}日）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "近 30 天最準點的 10 班車，依單日最糟全程誤點排序（同分再比平均誤點、有紀錄天數、車次號）；至少 20 天有紀錄才列入計算，資料來源台鐵": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The 10 most punctual trains over the past 30 days, ranked by their worst full-route delay day. Ties use average delay, days recorded and train number; at least 20 days of TRA records are required."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "過去30日で最も定時性の高い10列車。1日の全区間最大遅延で順位付けし、同点時は平均遅延・記録日数・列車番号を比較します。台湾鉄路の記録が20日以上ある列車が対象です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "近 90 天逐日最終誤點": {
