    "桌面也可以按 F": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On desktop you can also press F"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "デスクトップではFキーも利用可能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "桌面小工具的發車看板也標出北上／南下：Android 從零補上方向三角，兩個平台的三角一起放大，顏色換成台鐵官方的北上藍、南下綠": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Home screen departure widgets now mark northbound and southbound on every row: Android gains direction arrows for the first time, and on both platforms the arrows are larger and use TRA’s official blue for northbound and green for southbound."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ホーム画面の発車ウィジェットでも各行に上り／下りを表示：Android に方向の三角を新たに追加し、両プラットフォームとも三角を大きくして、台鉄公式の「上り＝青・下り＝緑」に変更しました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "桌面版的四顆分頁就在頂端資訊列上，直接點就能換": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On desktop, use the four tabs in the top information bar."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "デスクトップでは上部の4つのタブで切り替えます。"
          }
        }
