            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ソフトウェアパーク"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "逐列看：台鐵即時誤點是 LIVE 還是「非即時」、捷運看板校正到哪、是不是在重播、目前時段與車數": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review TRA live-delay status, metro board corrections, replay state, current period and train count"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "台湾鉄路の遅延、メトロ案内の補正、リプレイ状態、現在の時間帯と列車数を確認"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "逐車校正": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Per-train correction"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列車別補正"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這一站現在沒有官方班次資訊": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No official service information is available for this station right now."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この駅の公式列車情報は現在ありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這不代表列車停駛，請以月台看板為準。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This does not mean trains are suspended; check the platform display."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列車の運休を意味するものではありません。駅の案内表示をご確認ください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這台車已超過 30 秒不在即時模型中，已結束跟隨": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This train has been absent from the live model for over 30 seconds, so following ended."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この列車は30秒以上リアルタイムモデルにないため追跡を終了しました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這份檔案沒有可匯入的台灣地點。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This file has no places in Taiwan that can be imported."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このファイルには読み込める台湾の場所がありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這列車已離開官方即時名冊": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This train has left the official live roster."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この列車は公式リアルタイム名簿から外れました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這列車目前沒有可唯一確認的官方身分": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This train cannot currently be matched to a unique official identity."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この列車は現在、公式データ上の一意な列車として確認できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這是外部災害示警，不代表列車已停駛；軌島已加強重查台鐵、高鐵與捷運的官方營運公告{stale}。列車是否停駛請以各營運單位公告為準。來源：NCDR 民生示警公開資料平台。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These external hazard warnings do not mean that train service has been suspended. Rail Island is checking official service notices from TRA, HSR and metro operators more frequently{stale}. Follow each operator’s official notice to confirm whether trains are running. Source: NCDR Public Warning Platform."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これは外部の災害警報であり、列車の運休を示すものではありません。軌島は台湾鉄路・高鉄・各メトロの公式運行情報を通常より頻繁に確認しています{stale}。運休の有無は各事業者の公式情報をご確認ください。出典：NCDR民生警報公開資料プラットフォーム。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這是你的收集地圖——按上方「離開」回到即時地圖": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is your collection map—press Leave above to return to the live map"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "収集マップです。上部の「終了」でリアルタイム地図へ戻ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這是資料狀態——卡片右上的 ✕ 或按 Esc 關掉": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the data-status card. Close it with ✕ at the top right or press Esc."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "データ状態カードです。右上の✕またはEscキーで閉じられます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個地點附近今天沒有更晚的班次": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No later trains near this place today"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この場所の周辺では本日これ以降の列車がありません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個行程連結已過期（非今日班次）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This journey link has expired (not a service for today)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この旅程リンクは期限切れです（本日の列車ではありません）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個位置 {distance} 內沒有鐵路，無法預測經過的火車。拖曳釘子靠近鐵路再試。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is no railway within {distance} of this point, so passing trains cannot be predicted. Drag the pin closer to a railway and try again."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この地点の{distance}以内に鉄道がないため、通過列車を予測できません。ピンを線路の近くへドラッグして再度お試しください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個起站目前沒有可用的篩選項目。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No filters are currently available for this origin."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この出発駅で利用できる表示条件はありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "這個帳號目前沒有可恢復的通行證資格。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
