    "想放多站，或用「自動（最近的站）」讓它跟著你移動換站，需要軌島通行證（免費可設定一站）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A Rail Island Pass is required for multiple stations or Auto (nearest station), which changes as you move. One station is free."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "複数の駅、または移動に合わせて駅を変える「自動（最寄り駅）」には軌島パスが必要です。1駅は無料です。"
