    },
    "還有一張「鐵路＋捷運看板」大卡，把台鐵、高鐵與捷運的發車資訊列在同一張。點小工具會直接開啟軌島到那一站。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The large Rail and Metro Board combines TRA, HSR and metro departures. Tap a widget to open Rail Island at that station."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "大きな「鉄道＋メトロ案内」では台湾鉄路、高鉄、メトロの発車情報をまとめて表示します。押すと軌島でその駅を開きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒有收藏——跟隨列車後點資訊卡的收藏鈕收藏列車；打開車站看板點收藏鈕收藏車站；用工具列「儲存」在地圖上存地點。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No favourites yet. Follow a train and use its card’s favourite button; open a station board to favourite a station; or use Save on the toolbar to store a map place."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "お気に入りはまだありません。列車追跡カードや駅案内のお気に入りボタン、ツールバーの「保存」から追加できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒有你的位置，先按一次「附近車站」定位": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your location is not available yet. Use Nearby stations to locate first."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現在地がまだありません。先に「近くの駅」で測位してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒有完乘記錄——從地圖角落「探」挑一班有趣的車，陪它跑完全程吧。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No completed trips yet. Use Pick below the map to find a train and follow it for the full trip."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完乗記録はまだありません。地図の下にある「選」から列車を選び、終点まで追跡してみましょう。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒有排任何提醒": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No alerts scheduled yet"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定済みの通知はありません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒有搭乘記錄——用跟車面板的「我上車了」開始收集": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No travel records yet—use “I’m on board” in the follow panel to start collecting."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "乗車記録はまだありません。追跡パネルの「乗車する」から収集を始めましょう。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒搭過——點我去搭一班": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not collected yet—tap to ride one"
